        "TileImage": "$($repository 08d94d2a-fc81-479d-9d41-381485d02e8d).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47, and welcome to Marrakesh, where rebel leader Reza Zaydan and his army threaten to replace the Moroccan government. General Zaydan and his men have captured an undercover Moroccan official called Sayid Laham, who blew his cover after Zaydan&apos;s army accidentally killed his father. At the moment, they believe that Sayid is just a defector, but if they choose to interrogate him, he may reveal detials of the Moroccan military, to prevent this, Sayid must be eliminated.",
